  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/cardGame.yarn-CardGame_Main-11300": "神谕牌规则",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/cardGame.yarn-CardGame_Main-11301": "对局开始时，从牌组中选出五张牌作为手牌。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/cardGame.yarn-CardGame_Main-11302": "随后双方轮流从手牌中打出一张，放入棋盘格。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/cardGame.yarn-CardGame_Main-11303": ": 若打出的牌与对手的牌相邻，就按以下方式比较双方相对边上的数字：",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/cardGame.yarn-CardGame_Main-11304": "若你的数字较大，对手的牌就会翻转，变为你方的牌。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/cardGame.yarn-CardGame_Main-11305": "否则，不发生变化。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/cardGame.yarn-CardGame_Main-11306": "特殊规则",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/cardGame.yarn-CardGame_Main-11307": ": 每位对手都有一种适用于对局的特殊规则。本局规则如下：",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/cardGame.yarn-CardGame_Main-11308": "- 无特殊规则",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/cardGame.yarn-CardGame_Main-11309": "退出",
