  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/cardGame.yarn-CardGame_LoseText-11314": "你输了！下次再接再厉。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/cardGame.yarn-CardGame_WinText-11315": "你赢了！恭喜！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sheep.yarn-sheepStacking_init-11316": "第 {0} 关。按“\\[party\\]”退出或重来",
