  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sheep.yarn-sheepStacker_continue-11322": "FARMER: 干得好，小伙子！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sheep.yarn-sheepStacker_continue-11323": "接下来呢？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sheep.yarn-sheepStacker_continue-11324": "进入下一关！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sheep.yarn-sheepStacker_continue-11325": "见好就收！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sheep.yarn-debugSheepLevels-11326": "选择关卡！",
